      "title": "👕 T-Shirt Business Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for a tee brand or print shop, from Tee Break to The Ink Shed."
    },
    "intro": "Launching a print-on-demand store, a slogan tee brand or a screen-printing shop? This **t-shirt business name generator** gives you names in seven styles, from tea puns to proper print-shop names, and you can check each one is free before you order the first run.",
    "sections": [],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a t-shirt business name is free?",
        "answer": "Press <strong>Check</strong> on any name to see whether it is free as a company name, a web address and a social media handle. In the UK, search the Companies House register; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. Do this before you pay for a logo, labels or signage."
      },
      {
        "question": "What is a good name for a t-shirt business?",
        "answer": "One that says tees, print or ink, or hints at your designs, and still fits a neck label and a handle. Puns such as <em>Tee Break</em> suit a slogan or print-on-demand brand; a printing shop does better with a plain, local name such as <em>Hampton Screen Printing</em>. Steer clear of names close to platforms and big brands, such as Threadless or Redbubble."
      }
    ]
  }
